From 7be7e05266ea07f52b54f7c445b771cffa436f79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeyKul <jey@kulovac.de>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:38:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] media: cameras: add the stock low resolution modes

libcamera's software ISP crops instead of scaling, so small streams from a full
size mode looked zoomed in. Keep the new modes at 30 fps for full exposure.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
